  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'This is a turn-based 1v1 fighting game.


    Rounds are split into 10
    beats.


    Actions have a startup time, measured in beats, before they resolve.


    After
    an action resolves, a fighter has to recover, which takes more time measured
    in beats.


    Some fighters might recover faster or slower than you, meaning
    they''ll get to take action more or less frequently than you.


    Actions and
    recover can carry over into the next round if they aren''t finished by beat 10.


    If
    a fighter recovers on beat 10, they start the next round on beat 1. (This is
    due to a technical oversight.)


    Look at the status counters under each fighter
    to see how many beats are left before they do something.


    If a fighter gets
    hit while they''re preparing an action, they''ll get stunned, cancelling it.


    If
    you hit each other at the same time, you both take a bit of damage.


    The
    game ends when one or both of the fighters'' HP hits 0.


    Good luck!

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
